hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"159801","[1598] Malik told me, on the authority of Hisham ibn Urwa, on the authority of his father: The Messenger of God, peace and blessings be upon him, said: No one should leave the Medina without desire, unless God replaces it with something better than it.\\nA home in front of Malik Hadith: 1598 Arabic Hadith:"
"159802","[1598] Malik told me, on the authority of Hisham ibn Urwa, on the authority of his father: The Messenger of God, peace and blessings be upon him, said: No one should leave the Medina without desire, unless God replaces it with something better than it.\\nA home in front of Malik Hadith: 1598 Arabic Hadith:"
