"160201","Yahya narrated to me, from Malik, from Amr, the freed slave of al-Muttalib, from Anas ibn Malik."
"160202","Yahya narrated to me, from Malik, from Amr, the freed slave of al-Muttalib, from Anas ibn Malik: The Messenger of Allah ﷺ looked towards Uhud and said: This is a mountain that loves us and we love it. O Allah, Ibrahim forbade Makkah, and I forbid what is between its two lava fields."
