"160602","Malik related to me that he had heard that when Umar ibn Abd al- Aziz left Madina"
"160701","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Sa'id that 'A'ishah said: And 'Amir ibn Fuhayrah used to say:"
"160702","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Sa'id that 'A'ishah said: And 'Amir ibn Fuhayrah used to say: \I have seen death before tasting it. Indeed"
